#: setupdlg.cpp:508
msgid "P&oll (sec):"
msgstr "poll (sek):"

#: setupdlg.cpp:512
msgid ""
"This is the interval (in seconds) that KBiff will check for new mail.  "
"Typically, this can be quite small (under 60 seconds) for local mailboxes "
"but should be around 5 minutes (300 seconds) for remote mailboxes"
msgstr ""
"hierdie is die interval (in sekondes) wat kbiff sal bevestig vir nuwe pos.  "
"tipies, hierdie kan wees nogal klein (onder 60 sekondes) vir plaaslike "
"posbusse maar moet wees omtrent 5 minute (300 sekondes) vir afgeleë posbusse"

