#: setupdlg.cpp:920
msgid "Mailbox &URL:"
msgstr "posbus url:"

#: setupdlg.cpp:925
msgid ""
"KBiff uses URLs to specify a mailbox and the parameters to the mailbox.  "
"This allows you to modify the URL directly. Do so <i>only</i> if you really "
"really know what you're doing!"
msgstr ""

#: setupdlg.cpp:930
msgid "P&ort:"
msgstr "poort:"

#: setupdlg.cpp:935
msgid ""
"This allows you to specify the port of your socket protocol. It usually is "
"correct, so the only time you would change it is if you are accessing a "
"non-standard server or going through a proxy (or something similar"
msgstr ""
"hierdie laat toe jy aan spesifiseer die poort van jou soket protokol. dit "
"gewoonlik is korrek, sodat die slegs tyd jy sal verander dit is as jy word "
"toegang te kry tot 'n non-standard bediener of gaan deur 'n volmag (of iets "
"soortgelyk"

#: setupdlg.cpp:942
msgid ""
"IMAP4, POP3, and NNTP sockets each have their own timeout before they give "
"up. If you have a slow connection, you might want to set this to some random "
"high value"
msgstr ""
"imap4, pop3, en nntp sokets elke het hulle eie tydverstreke voor hulle gee "
"begin. as jy het 'n stadige verbinding, jy dalk wil hê aan stel hierdie aan "
"sommige lukrake hoog waarde"

#: setupdlg.cpp:945
msgid "&Timeout:"
msgstr "tydverstreke:"

#: setupdlg.cpp:951
msgid "&PREAUTH"
msgstr "preauth?"

#: setupdlg.cpp:954
msgid ""
"Check this if you login to your IMAP4 or POP3 server before kbiff accesses "
"it."
msgstr ""
"bevestig hierdie as jy aanteken aan jou imap4 of pop3 bediener voor kbiff "
"toegang verkry tot dit."

#: setupdlg.cpp:958
msgid "&Keep Alive"
msgstr "hou lewendig"

#: setupdlg.cpp:961
msgid ""
"If this is checked, then the IMAP4, POP3, or NNTP client will not log off "
"each time"
msgstr ""
"as hierdie is nagegaan, dan word die imap4, pop3, of nntp kliënt sal nie "
"log af elke tyd"

#: setupdlg.cpp:965
msgid "&Asynchronous"
msgstr "asinkroon"

#: setupdlg.cpp:968
msgid ""
"If this is checked, then the socket protocols will access the server "
"asynchronously"
msgstr ""
"as hierdie is nagegaan, dan word die soket protokolle sal toegang verkry die "
"bediener asinkroon"

